      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "槽位任务上下文大小历史",
      "description": "每槽位当前/最近任务的 prompt tokens。阶梯保持=槽位空闲后保留上一任务水位; 断线=llama-server未运行。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "vllm-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "llamaslot_n_prompt_tokens",
